{"id":"wb-6-748","name":"真庆观古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"真庆观","text":"真庆观古建筑群位于云南省昆明市盘龙区拓东路与白塔路交叉路口，由真庆观、都雷府、盐隆祠三部分组成，总占地面积2.07万平方米，是昆明主城区内最大的古建筑群。1998年11月，真庆观被公布为云南省文物保护单位，2006年，其又被国务院公布为第六批国家级重点文物保护单位。除一般文化和宗教职能外，真庆观还是昆明市道教协会所在地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9C%9F%E5%BA%86%E8%A7%82","revisionId":89092621,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89092621","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d10cbb4ba26b72f58a86b845.jpg","title":"真庆观_山门.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%9C%9F%E5%BA%86%E8%A7%82_%E5%B1%B1%E9%97%A8.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/%E7%9C%9F%E5%BA%86%E8%A7%82_%E5%B1%B1%E9%97%A8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Zhenqing Taoist Temple: gate","width":320,"height":213}}